  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the elementalist chooses one blast type group from the Destruction sphere. When creating a destructive blast from this blast type group, it deals an additional +1/2 damage per elementalist level.</p>\n<p>At 9th and 15th level, the elementalist chooses an additional favored element, gaining the same bonus. In addition, the bonus granted by his previous favored elements increase by an additional +1/2 damage per elementalist level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/elementalist#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
